title: "Road Accidents Risk Modeling platform"
abstract: >-
  A reusable geospatial road-accident risk-modeling platform that scores and
  explains collision risk at segment, junction, and crossing level to help road
  authorities prioritise safety interventions (Safe System / Vision Zero),
  applicable across cities and countries.
type: software
